Package: dconf
Version: @DEB_DCONF_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wiki.gnome.org/Projects/dconf
Depends: libglib2.0-0, dbus
Description: Low-level GSettings configuration backend
 dconf is the default GSettings backend. This package provides libdconf, the
 GIO settings backend module (libdconfsettings.so) that makes desktop settings
 persist, the dconf-service D-Bus service, and the dconf command-line tool.
 Requires a D-Bus session bus at runtime (the dbus package).
